<title>ISRAEL: Israel's IDB Holding Q2 net up.</title>
<headline>Israel's IDB Holding Q2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDB Holding Corp, one of Israel's leading holding companies.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		396,585     404,401    820,384     725,517</p>
<p>Pretax profit	103,299     102,875    223,932     179,012</p>
<p>Net profit	    35,681	30,590     76,478	48,854</p>
<p>($1 = 3.20 shekels on June 30)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
